e":"heading","depth":5,"id":"ctx-10","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ctx"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"ChatMiddlewareContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChatMiddlewareContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"info-5","children":[{"type":"text","value":"info"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"IterationInfo.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IterationInfo"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-10","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onshouldcontinue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onShouldContinue?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional onShouldContinue?: (ctx, state) => boolean | void | Promise<boolean | void>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L764","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:764"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called when the engine is deciding whether to start another agent-loop\niteration (after a tool phase or between model turns)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Return "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":" to stop further iterations. Return "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":", or\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" to allow continuation. Combined with AND semantics across\nmiddleware and with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"agentLoopStrategy"},{"type":"text","value":" — any "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":" stops the loop."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Does not abort the run: the stream finishes normally with the current\nmessages. Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ctx.abort()"},{"type":"text","value":" only when you need a hard abort."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Receives the same "},{"type":"link","href":"AgentLoopState.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"AgentLoopState"}]},{"type":"text","value":" passed to strategies\n("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"iterationCount"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toolCallCount"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lastTurnToolCallCount"},{"type":"text","value":", etc.)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-11","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"ctx-11","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ctx"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"ChatMiddlewareContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChatMiddlewareContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"state","children":[{"type":"text","value":"state"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"AgentLoopState.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AgentLoopState"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-11","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onstart","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onStart?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional onStart?: (ctx) => void | Promise<void>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L739","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:739"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called when the chat run starts (after initial onConfig)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-12","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"ctx-12","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ctx"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"ChatMiddlewareContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChatMiddlewareContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-12","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onstructuredoutputconfig","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onStructuredOutputConfig?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional onStructuredOutputConfig?: (ctx, config) => \n  | void\n  | Partial<StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig>\n  | Promise<\n  | void\n  | Partial<StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig>\n  | null>\n  | null;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L727","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:727"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called at the start of the final structured-output call (when the chat\nwas invoked with outputSchema). Pipes through middleware in order, like\nonConfig, but with access to the JSON Schema being sent to the provider."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Return a partial to shallow-merge into the current config, or void to\npass through."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Fires BEFORE onConfig at the structured-output boundary. onConfig also\nre-fires at the same boundary with ctx.phase === 'structuredOutput',\nreceiving the post-onStructuredOutputConfig view of the config (minus\noutputSchema). Use onConfig for general-purpose transforms that apply\nto every adapter call; use this hook when you need to transform the\noutputSchema or apply structured-output-specific behavior."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-13","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"ctx-13","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ctx"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"ChatMiddlewareContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChatMiddlewareContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"config-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"config"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-13","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":"\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Partial"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig"}]},{"type":"text","value":">\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":"\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Partial"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig"}]},{"type":"text","value":">\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"null"},{"type":"text","value":">\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"null"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ontoolphasecomplete","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onToolPhaseComplete?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional onToolPhaseComplete?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L806","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:806"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called after all tool calls in an iteration have been processed.\nProvides aggregate data about tool execution results, approvals, and client tools."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-14","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"ctx-14","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ctx"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"ChatMiddlewareContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChatMiddlewareContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"info-6","children":[{"type":"text","value":"info"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"ToolPhaseCompleteInfo.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ToolPhaseCompleteInfo"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-14","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onusage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onUsage?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional onUsage?: (ctx, usage) => void | Promise<void>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L815","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:815"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called when usage data is available from a RUN_FINISHED chunk.\nCalled once per model iteration that reports usage."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-15","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"ctx-15","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ctx"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"ChatMiddlewareContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChatMiddlewareContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"usage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"usage"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"UsageInfo.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"UsageInfo"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-15","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"optionalrequires","children":[{"type":"text","value":"optionalRequires?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional optionalRequires?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L686","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:686"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Capabilities this middleware uses if present but does not require.\nNon-gating: never causes a validation error. Read with\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getX(ctx, { optional: true })"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"provides","children":[{"type":"text","value":"provides?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional provides?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L679","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:679"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Capabilities this middleware provides. Each declared capability MUST be\nprovided (via its "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"provide"},{"type":"text","value":" accessor) inside "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"setup"},{"type":"text","value":", or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chat()"},{"type":"text","value":" throws\nafter the setup phase."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"requires","children":[{"type":"text","value":"requires?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional requires?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L672","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:672"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Capabilities this middleware requires. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chat()"},{"type":"text","value":" validates that some\nmiddleware (or the adapter) provides each one; unsatisfied requirements are\na compile-time error (array coverage / builder) and a runtime error before\nthe adapter runs."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"routedsubagentpersistence","children":[{"type":"text","value":"routedSubagentPersistence?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional routedSubagentPersistence?: RoutedSubagentPersistence;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L645","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:645"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Present when this middleware stores subagent runs.\nThe router calls it. An app does not set it."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"sandbox","children":[{"type":"text","value":"sandbox?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional sandbox?: ChatSandboxHooks<TContext>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L851","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:851"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sandbox file-event hooks. Fire when a sandbox provided by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"withSandbox"},{"type":"text","value":" is\nactive during the run and a file is created/changed/deleted. Server-side."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"setup?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional setup?: (ctx) => void | Promise<void>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L694","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:694"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provisioning hook. Runs FIRST — before "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onConfig"},{"type":"text","value":" (init) — across all\nmiddleware in array order. Use it to call "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"provide"},{"type":"text","value":" accessors so later\nmiddleware ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onConfig"},{"type":"text","value":" onward) can consume the capabilities. Receives the\nstable context; does NOT receive the mutable config."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-16","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"ctx-16","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ctx"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"ChatMiddlewareContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChatMiddlewareContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-16","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"extended-by","text":"Extended by","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tcontext","text":"TContext","level":3},{"id":"tinterruptdefinitions","text":"TInterruptDefinitions","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"name","text":"name?","level":3},{"id":"onabort","text":"onAbort?","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"info","text":"info","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"onaftertoolcall","text":"onAfterToolCall?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-2","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"info-2","text":"info","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"onbeforetoolcall","text":"onBeforeToolCall?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-3","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-3","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"hookctx","text":"hookCtx","level":5},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"onchunk","text":"onChunk?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-4","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-4","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"chunk","text":"chunk","level":5},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"onconfig","text":"onConfig?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-5","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-5","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"config","text":"config","level":5},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"onerror","text":"onError?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-6","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-6","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"info-3","text":"info","level":5},{"id":"returns-6","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"onfinish","text":"onFinish?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-7","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-7","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"info-4","text":"info","level":5},{"id":"returns-7","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"oninterruptboundary","text":"onInterruptBoundary?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-8","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-8","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"returns-8","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"oninterruptresolution","text":"onInterruptResolution?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-9","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-9","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"resolutions","text":"resolutions","level":5},{"id":"returns-9","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"oniteration","text":"onIteration?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-10","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-10","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"info-5","text":"info","level":5},{"id":"returns-10","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"onshouldcontinue","text":"onShouldContinue?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-11","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-11","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"state","text":"state","level":5},{"id":"returns-11","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"onstart","text":"onStart?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-12","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-12","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"returns-12","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"onstructuredoutputconfig","text":"onStructuredOutputConfig?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-13","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-13","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"config-2","text":"config","level":5},{"id":"returns-13","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"ontoolphasecomplete","text":"onToolPhaseComplete?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-14","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-14","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"info-6","text":"info","level":5},{"id":"returns-14","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"onusage","text":"onUsage?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-15","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-15","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"usage","text":"usage","level":5},{"id":"returns-15","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"optionalrequires","text":"optionalRequires?","level":3},{"id":"provides","text":"provides?","level":3},{"id":"requires","text":"requires?","level":3},{"id":"routedsubagentpersistence","text":"routedSubagentPersistence?","level":3},{"id":"sandbox","text":"sandbox?","level":3},{"id":"setup","text":"setup?","level":3},{"id":"parameters-16","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-16","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"returns-16","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:634](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L634)\n\nChat middleware interface.\n\nAll hooks are optional. Middleware is composed in array order:\n- `onConfig`: config piped through middlewares in order (first transform influences later)\n- `onChunk`: each output chunk is fed into the next middleware in order\n\n## Examples\n\n**Logging middleware**\n\n```ts\nconst loggingMiddleware: ChatMiddleware = {\n  name: 'logging',\n  onStart(ctx) { console.log('Chat started', ctx.requestId) },\n  onChunk(ctx, chunk) { console.log('Chunk:', chunk.type) },\n  onFinish(ctx, info) { console.log('Done:', info.duration, 'ms') },\n}\n```\n\n**Redaction middleware**\n\n```ts\nconst redactionMiddleware: ChatMiddleware = {\n  name: 'redaction',\n  onChunk(ctx, chunk) {\n    if (chunk.type === 'TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT') {\n      return { ...chunk, delta: redact(chunk.delta) }\n    }\n  },\n}\n```\n\n## Extended by\n\n- [`DefinedChatMiddleware`](DefinedChatMiddleware.md)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TContext\n\n`TContext` = `unknown`\n\n### TInterruptDefinitions\n\n`TInterruptDefinitions` *extends* `AnyInterruptDefinition` = `never`\n\n## Properties\n\n### name?\n\n```ts\noptional name?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:639](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L639)\n\nOptional name for debugging and identification\n\n***\n\n### onAbort?\n\n```ts\noptional onAbort?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:833](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L833)\n\nCalled when the chat run is aborted.\nExactly one of onFinish/onAbort/onError will be called per run.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`AbortInfo`](AbortInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onAfterToolCall?\n\n```ts\noptional onAfterToolCall?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:797](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L797)\n\nCalled after a tool execution completes (success or failure).\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`AfterToolCallInfo`](AfterToolCallInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onBeforeToolCall?\n\n```ts\noptional onBeforeToolCall?: (ctx, hookCtx) => \n  | BeforeToolCallDecision\n| Promise<BeforeToolCallDecision>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:789](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L789)\n\nCalled before a tool is executed.\nCan observe, transform args, skip execution, or abort the run.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### hookCtx\n\n[`ToolCallHookContext`](ToolCallHookContext.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| [`BeforeToolCallDecision`](../type-aliases/BeforeToolCallDecision.md)\n  \\| `Promise`\\<[`BeforeToolCallDecision`](../type-aliases/BeforeToolCallDecision.md)\\>\n\n***\n\n### onChunk?\n\n```ts\noptional onChunk?: (ctx, chunk) => \n  | void\n  | AGUIEvent\n  | AGUIEvent[]\n  | Promise<void | AGUIEvent | AGUIEvent[] | null>\n  | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:775](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L775)\n\nCalled for every chunk yielded by chat().\nCan observe, transform, expand, or drop chunks.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### chunk\n\n[`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| [`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)\n  \\| [`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)[]\n  \\| `Promise`\\<void \\| AGUIEvent \\| AGUIEvent\\[\\] \\| null\\>\n  \\| `null`\n\nvoid (pass through), chunk (replace), chunk[] (expand), null (drop)\n\n***\n\n### onConfig?\n\n```ts\noptional onConfig?: (ctx, config) => \n  | void\n  | Partial<ChatMiddlewareConfig>\n  | Promise<\n  | void\n  | Partial<ChatMiddlewareConfig>\n  | null>\n  | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:703](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L703)\n\nCalled to observe or transform the chat configuration.\nCalled at init and at the beginning of each agent iteration.\n\nReturn a partial config to merge with the current config, or void to pass through.\nOnly the fields you return are overwritten — everything else is preserved.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### config\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareConfig`](ChatMiddlewareConfig.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| `Partial`\\<[`ChatMiddlewareConfig`](ChatMiddlewareConfig.md)\\>\n  \\| `Promise`\\<\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| `Partial`\\<[`ChatMiddlewareConfig`](ChatMiddlewareConfig.md)\\>\n  \\| `null`\\>\n  \\| `null`\n\n***\n\n### onError?\n\n```ts\noptional onError?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:842](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L842)\n\nCalled when the chat run encounters an unhandled error.\nExactly one of onFinish/onAbort/onError will be called per run.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`ErrorInfo`](ErrorInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onFinish?\n\n```ts\noptional onFinish?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:824](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L824)\n\nCalled when the chat run completes normally.\nExactly one of onFinish/onAbort/onError will be called per run.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`FinishInfo`](FinishInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onInterruptBoundary?\n\n```ts\noptional onInterruptBoundary?: (ctx) => \n  | InterruptBoundaryResult<TInterruptDefinitions>\n| Promise<InterruptBoundaryResult<TInterruptDefinitions>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:651](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L651)\n\nCalled at a lifecycle boundary. Return interrupt requests to pause the run.\nRequests from every middleware in the same boundary form one batch.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\> & `object`\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| [`InterruptBoundaryResult`](../type-aliases/InterruptBoundaryResult.md)\\<`TInterruptDefinitions`\\>\n  \\| `Promise`\\<[`InterruptBoundaryResult`](../type-aliases/InterruptBoundaryResult.md)\\<`TInterruptDefinitions`\\>\\>\n\n***\n\n### onInterruptResolution?\n\n```ts\noptional onInterruptResolution?: (ctx, resolutions) => \n  | InterruptResolutionResult\n| Promise<InterruptResolutionResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:661](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L661)\n\nCalled on a continuation run after the client answers registered interrupts.\nReturn `toolResume` to decide whether pending tools continue, cancel, or stop.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### resolutions\n\n[`InterruptResolutionCollection`](InterruptResolutionCollection.md)\\<`TInterruptDefinitions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| [`InterruptResolutionResult`](../type-aliases/InterruptResolutionResult.md)\n  \\| `Promise`\\<[`InterruptResolutionResult`](../type-aliases/InterruptResolutionResult.md)\\>\n\n***\n\n### onIteration?\n\n```ts\noptional onIteration?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:745](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L745)\n\nCalled at the start of each agent loop iteration, after a new assistant message ID\nis created. Use this to observe iteration boundaries.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`IterationInfo`](IterationInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onShouldContinue?\n\n```ts\noptional onShouldContinue?: (ctx, state) => boolean | void | Promise<boolean | void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:764](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L764)\n\nCalled when the engine is deciding whether to start another agent-loop\niteration (after a tool phase or between model turns).\n\nReturn `false` to stop further iterations. Return `true`, `void`, or\n`undefined` to allow continuation. Combined with AND semantics across\nmiddleware and with `agentLoopStrategy` — any `false` stops the loop.\n\nDoes not abort the run: the stream finishes normally with the current\nmessages. Use `ctx.abort()` only when you need a hard abort.\n\nReceives the same [AgentLoopState](AgentLoopState.md) passed to strategies\n(`iterationCount`, `toolCallCount`, `lastTurnToolCallCount`, etc.).\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### state\n\n[`AgentLoopState`](AgentLoopState.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean` \\| `void` \\| `Promise`\\<`boolean` \\| `void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onStart?\n\n```ts\noptional onStart?: (ctx) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:739](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L739)\n\nCalled when the chat run starts (after initial onConfig).\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onStructuredOutputConfig?\n\n```ts\noptional onStructuredOutputConfig?: (ctx, config) => \n  | void\n  | Partial<StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig>\n  | Promise<\n  | void\n  | Partial<StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig>\n  | null>\n  | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:727](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L727)\n\nCalled at the start of the final structured-output call (when the chat\nwas invoked with outputSchema). Pipes through middleware in order, like\nonConfig, but with access to the JSON Schema being sent to the provider.\n\nReturn a partial to shallow-merge into the current config, or void to\npass through.\n\nFires BEFORE onConfig at the structured-output boundary. onConfig also\nre-fires at the same boundary with ctx.phase === 'structuredOutput',\nreceiving the post-onStructuredOutputConfig view of the config (minus\noutputSchema). Use onConfig for general-purpose transforms that apply\nto every adapter call; use this hook when you need to transform the\noutputSchema or apply structured-output-specific behavior.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### config\n\n[`StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig`](StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| `Partial`\\<[`StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig`](StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig.md)\\>\n  \\| `Promise`\\<\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| `Partial`\\<[`StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig`](StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig.md)\\>\n  \\| `null`\\>\n  \\| `null`\n\n***\n\n### onToolPhaseComplete?\n\n```ts\noptional onToolPhaseComplete?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:806](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L806)\n\nCalled after all tool calls in an iteration have been processed.\nProvides aggregate data about tool execution results, approvals, and client tools.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`ToolPhaseCompleteInfo`](ToolPhaseCompleteInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onUsage?\n\n```ts\noptional onUsage?: (ctx, usage) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:815](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L815)\n\nCalled when usage data is available from a RUN_FINISHED chunk.\nCalled once per model iteration that reports usage.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### usage\n\n[`UsageInfo`](UsageInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### optionalRequires?\n\n```ts\noptional optionalRequires?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:686](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L686)\n\nCapabilities this middleware uses if present but does not require.\nNon-gating: never causes a validation error. Read with\n`getX(ctx, { optional: true })`.\n\n***\n\n### provides?\n\n```ts\noptional provides?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:679](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L679)\n\nCapabilities this middleware provides. Each declared capability MUST be\nprovided (via its `provide` accessor) inside `setup`, or `chat()` throws\nafter the setup phase.\n\n***\n\n### requires?\n\n```ts\noptional requires?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:672](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L672)\n\nCapabilities this middleware requires. `chat()` validates that some\nmiddleware (or the adapter) provides each one; unsatisfied requirements are\na compile-time error (array coverage / builder) and a runtime error before\nthe adapter runs.\n\n***\n\n### routedSubagentPersistence?\n\n```ts\noptional routedSubagentPersistence?: RoutedSubagentPersistence;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:645](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L645)\n\nPresent when this middleware stores subagent runs.\nThe router calls it. An app does not set it.\n\n***\n\n### sandbox?\n\n```ts\noptional sandbox?: ChatSandboxHooks<TContext>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:851](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L851)\n\nSandbox file-event hooks. Fire when a sandbox provided by `withSandbox` is\nactive during the run and a file is created/changed/deleted. Server-side.\n\n***\n\n### setup?\n\n```ts\noptional setup?: (ctx) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:694](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L694)\n\nProvisioning hook. Runs FIRST — before `onConfig` (init) — across all\nmiddleware in array order. Use it to call `provide` accessors so later\nmiddleware (`onConfig` onward) can consume the capabilities. Receives the\nstable context; does NOT receive the mutable config.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ChatMiddleware\ntitle: ChatMiddleware\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:634](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L634)\n\nChat middleware interface.\n\nAll hooks are optional. Middleware is composed in array order:\n- `onConfig`: config piped through middlewares in order (first transform influences later)\n- `onChunk`: each output chunk is fed into the next middleware in order\n\n## Examples\n\n**Logging middleware**\n\n```ts\nconst loggingMiddleware: ChatMiddleware = {\n  name: 'logging',\n  onStart(ctx) { console.log('Chat started', ctx.requestId) },\n  onChunk(ctx, chunk) { console.log('Chunk:', chunk.type) },\n  onFinish(ctx, info) { console.log('Done:', info.duration, 'ms') },\n}\n```\n\n**Redaction middleware**\n\n```ts\nconst redactionMiddleware: ChatMiddleware = {\n  name: 'redaction',\n  onChunk(ctx, chunk) {\n    if (chunk.type === 'TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT') {\n      return { ...chunk, delta: redact(chunk.delta) }\n    }\n  },\n}\n```\n\n## Extended by\n\n- [`DefinedChatMiddleware`](DefinedChatMiddleware.md)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TContext\n\n`TContext` = `unknown`\n\n### TInterruptDefinitions\n\n`TInterruptDefinitions` *extends* `AnyInterruptDefinition` = `never`\n\n## Properties\n\n### name?\n\n```ts\noptional name?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:639](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L639)\n\nOptional name for debugging and identification\n\n***\n\n### onAbort?\n\n```ts\noptional onAbort?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:833](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L833)\n\nCalled when the chat run is aborted.\nExactly one of onFinish/onAbort/onError will be called per run.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`AbortInfo`](AbortInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onAfterToolCall?\n\n```ts\noptional onAfterToolCall?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:797](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L797)\n\nCalled after a tool execution completes (success or failure).\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`AfterToolCallInfo`](AfterToolCallInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onBeforeToolCall?\n\n```ts\noptional onBeforeToolCall?: (ctx, hookCtx) => \n  | BeforeToolCallDecision\n| Promise<BeforeToolCallDecision>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:789](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L789)\n\nCalled before a tool is executed.\nCan observe, transform args, skip execution, or abort the run.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### hookCtx\n\n[`ToolCallHookContext`](ToolCallHookContext.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| [`BeforeToolCallDecision`](../type-aliases/BeforeToolCallDecision.md)\n  \\| `Promise`\\<[`BeforeToolCallDecision`](../type-aliases/BeforeToolCallDecision.md)\\>\n\n***\n\n### onChunk?\n\n```ts\noptional onChunk?: (ctx, chunk) => \n  | void\n  | AGUIEvent\n  | AGUIEvent[]\n  | Promise<void | AGUIEvent | AGUIEvent[] | null>\n  | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:775](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L775)\n\nCalled for every chunk yielded by chat().\nCan observe, transform, expand, or drop chunks.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### chunk\n\n[`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| [`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)\n  \\| [`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)[]\n  \\| `Promise`\\<void \\| AGUIEvent \\| AGUIEvent\\[\\] \\| null\\>\n  \\| `null`\n\nvoid (pass through), chunk (replace), chunk[] (expand), null (drop)\n\n***\n\n### onConfig?\n\n```ts\noptional onConfig?: (ctx, config) => \n  | void\n  | Partial<ChatMiddlewareConfig>\n  | Promise<\n  | void\n  | Partial<ChatMiddlewareConfig>\n  | null>\n  | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:703](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L703)\n\nCalled to observe or transform the chat configuration.\nCalled at init and at the beginning of each agent iteration.\n\nReturn a partial config to merge with the current config, or void to pass through.\nOnly the fields you return are overwritten — everything else is preserved.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### config\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareConfig`](ChatMiddlewareConfig.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| `Partial`\\<[`ChatMiddlewareConfig`](ChatMiddlewareConfig.md)\\>\n  \\| `Promise`\\<\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| `Partial`\\<[`ChatMiddlewareConfig`](ChatMiddlewareConfig.md)\\>\n  \\| `null`\\>\n  \\| `null`\n\n***\n\n### onError?\n\n```ts\noptional onError?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:842](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L842)\n\nCalled when the chat run encounters an unhandled error.\nExactly one of onFinish/onAbort/onError will be called per run.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`ErrorInfo`](ErrorInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onFinish?\n\n```ts\noptional onFinish?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:824](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L824)\n\nCalled when the chat run completes normally.\nExactly one of onFinish/onAbort/onError will be called per run.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`FinishInfo`](FinishInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onInterruptBoundary?\n\n```ts\noptional onInterruptBoundary?: (ctx) => \n  | InterruptBoundaryResult<TInterruptDefinitions>\n| Promise<InterruptBoundaryResult<TInterruptDefinitions>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:651](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L651)\n\nCalled at a lifecycle boundary. Return interrupt requests to pause the run.\nRequests from every middleware in the same boundary form one batch.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\> & `object`\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| [`InterruptBoundaryResult`](../type-aliases/InterruptBoundaryResult.md)\\<`TInterruptDefinitions`\\>\n  \\| `Promise`\\<[`InterruptBoundaryResult`](../type-aliases/InterruptBoundaryResult.md)\\<`TInterruptDefinitions`\\>\\>\n\n***\n\n### onInterruptResolution?\n\n```ts\noptional onInterruptResolution?: (ctx, resolutions) => \n  | InterruptResolutionResult\n| Promise<InterruptResolutionResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:661](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L661)\n\nCalled on a continuation run after the client answers registered interrupts.\nReturn `toolResume` to decide whether pending tools continue, cancel, or stop.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### resolutions\n\n[`InterruptResolutionCollection`](InterruptResolutionCollection.md)\\<`TInterruptDefinitions`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| [`InterruptResolutionResult`](../type-aliases/InterruptResolutionResult.md)\n  \\| `Promise`\\<[`InterruptResolutionResult`](../type-aliases/InterruptResolutionResult.md)\\>\n\n***\n\n### onIteration?\n\n```ts\noptional onIteration?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:745](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L745)\n\nCalled at the start of each agent loop iteration, after a new assistant message ID\nis created. Use this to observe iteration boundaries.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`IterationInfo`](IterationInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onShouldContinue?\n\n```ts\noptional onShouldContinue?: (ctx, state) => boolean | void | Promise<boolean | void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:764](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L764)\n\nCalled when the engine is deciding whether to start another agent-loop\niteration (after a tool phase or between model turns).\n\nReturn `false` to stop further iterations. Return `true`, `void`, or\n`undefined` to allow continuation. Combined with AND semantics across\nmiddleware and with `agentLoopStrategy` — any `false` stops the loop.\n\nDoes not abort the run: the stream finishes normally with the current\nmessages. Use `ctx.abort()` only when you need a hard abort.\n\nReceives the same [AgentLoopState](AgentLoopState.md) passed to strategies\n(`iterationCount`, `toolCallCount`, `lastTurnToolCallCount`, etc.).\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### state\n\n[`AgentLoopState`](AgentLoopState.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean` \\| `void` \\| `Promise`\\<`boolean` \\| `void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onStart?\n\n```ts\noptional onStart?: (ctx) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:739](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L739)\n\nCalled when the chat run starts (after initial onConfig).\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onStructuredOutputConfig?\n\n```ts\noptional onStructuredOutputConfig?: (ctx, config) => \n  | void\n  | Partial<StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig>\n  | Promise<\n  | void\n  | Partial<StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig>\n  | null>\n  | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:727](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L727)\n\nCalled at the start of the final structured-output call (when the chat\nwas invoked with outputSchema). Pipes through middleware in order, like\nonConfig, but with access to the JSON Schema being sent to the provider.\n\nReturn a partial to shallow-merge into the current config, or void to\npass through.\n\nFires BEFORE onConfig at the structured-output boundary. onConfig also\nre-fires at the same boundary with ctx.phase === 'structuredOutput',\nreceiving the post-onStructuredOutputConfig view of the config (minus\noutputSchema). Use onConfig for general-purpose transforms that apply\nto every adapter call; use this hook when you need to transform the\noutputSchema or apply structured-output-specific behavior.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### config\n\n[`StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig`](StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| `Partial`\\<[`StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig`](StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig.md)\\>\n  \\| `Promise`\\<\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| `Partial`\\<[`StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig`](StructuredOutputMiddlewareConfig.md)\\>\n  \\| `null`\\>\n  \\| `null`\n\n***\n\n### onToolPhaseComplete?\n\n```ts\noptional onToolPhaseComplete?: (ctx, info) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:806](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L806)\n\nCalled after all tool calls in an iteration have been processed.\nProvides aggregate data about tool execution results, approvals, and client tools.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### info\n\n[`ToolPhaseCompleteInfo`](ToolPhaseCompleteInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### onUsage?\n\n```ts\noptional onUsage?: (ctx, usage) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:815](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L815)\n\nCalled when usage data is available from a RUN_FINISHED chunk.\nCalled once per model iteration that reports usage.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n##### usage\n\n[`UsageInfo`](UsageInfo.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n***\n\n### optionalRequires?\n\n```ts\noptional optionalRequires?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:686](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L686)\n\nCapabilities this middleware uses if present but does not require.\nNon-gating: never causes a validation error. Read with\n`getX(ctx, { optional: true })`.\n\n***\n\n### provides?\n\n```ts\noptional provides?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:679](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L679)\n\nCapabilities this middleware provides. Each declared capability MUST be\nprovided (via its `provide` accessor) inside `setup`, or `chat()` throws\nafter the setup phase.\n\n***\n\n### requires?\n\n```ts\noptional requires?: readonly CapabilityHandle[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:672](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L672)\n\nCapabilities this middleware requires. `chat()` validates that some\nmiddleware (or the adapter) provides each one; unsatisfied requirements are\na compile-time error (array coverage / builder) and a runtime error before\nthe adapter runs.\n\n***\n\n### routedSubagentPersistence?\n\n```ts\noptional routedSubagentPersistence?: RoutedSubagentPersistence;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:645](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L645)\n\nPresent when this middleware stores subagent runs.\nThe router calls it. An app does not set it.\n\n***\n\n### sandbox?\n\n```ts\noptional sandbox?: ChatSandboxHooks<TContext>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:851](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L851)\n\nSandbox file-event hooks. Fire when a sandbox provided by `withSandbox` is\nactive during the run and a file is created/changed/deleted. Server-side.\n\n***\n\n### setup?\n\n```ts\noptional setup?: (ctx) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:694](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L694)\n\nProvisioning hook. Runs FIRST — before `onConfig` (init) — across all\nmiddleware in array order. Use it to call `provide` accessors so later\nmiddleware (`onConfig` onward) can consume the capabilities. Receives the\nstable context; does NOT receive the mutable config.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`ChatMiddlewareContext`](ChatMiddlewareContext.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n"}
